	"Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - Policy - Rule - Okta Policy Rule Modified",
	"Description": "A rule inside an Okta policy was modified. Compare the before and after in the Okta admin console: a rule that now excludes a network zone or drops a factor requirement is a control change, not maintenance.\n\nEvent type: policy.rule.update\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/defense_evasion_okta_attempt_to_modify_okta_policy_rule/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
